<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-zhengao" book-id="b-zhengao-020" chapter-id="c-zhengao-020-jin080-xumai" source-id="s-zhengao-020-jin080-xumai">
  <p id="c-zhengao-020-jin080-xumai:names" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">先生名<persName id="c-zhengao-020-jin080-xumai:names:m0003" ref="972_dh9_hz4">邁</persName>，字<persName id="c-zhengao-020-jin080-xumai:names:m0006" ref="972_dh9_hz4">叔玄</persName>，小名<persName id="c-zhengao-020-jin080-xumai:names:m0011" ref="972_dh9_hz4">映</persName>，清虛懷道，遐棲世外，故自改名<persName id="c-zhengao-020-jin080-xumai:names:m0027" ref="972_dh9_hz4">遠遊</persName>，與<persName id="c-zhengao-020-jin080-xumai:names:m0031" ref="326_faf_cd3">王右軍</persName>父子周旋。</p>
  <p id="c-zhengao-020-jin080-xumai:sun" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">娶吳郡<persName id="c-zhengao-020-jin080-xumai:sun:m0003" ref="4xl_1hw_6cg">孫宏</persName>，字<persName id="c-zhengao-020-jin080-xumai:sun:m0007" ref="4xl_1hw_6cg">彥達</persName>女，即驃騎<rs id="c-zhengao-020-jin080-xumai:sun:u-xiu" type="unresolved">秀</rs>之孫。既離好，無子歸宗。</p>
</text>
